# Engineering Constitution v2 (mandatory)

Before implementing any development / feature / bugfix / refactor prompt:

## Prompt Contract

1. Read `docs/engineering/ENGINEERING_CONSTITUTION.md`  
2. Read `docs/engineering/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`  
3. Read relevant `docs/adr/*`  
4. Honor Runtime Boundary (Protected Modules)  
5. Produce Impact Analysis (Affected / Not Affected)  
6. Declare Business Goal  

Then follow: Audit → Architecture → Impact → Implement → Tests → Cleanup → Report → Deploy → Smoke.

If the user prompt conflicts with the Constitution → **warn first**.

Also enforced by: `product-philosophy.mdc`, `runtime-boundary.mdc`, `architecture-first.mdc`, `impact-analysis.mdc`.
